00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.567
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Look at this.

00:04:25.567 --> 00:04:26.667
But then --

00:04:30.067 --> 00:04:32.801
-That's a goat.
That's a goat.

00:04:32.801 --> 00:04:34.200
-Yeah.
Now, how did --

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.868
how did a goat get on stage
and who brought the goat?

00:04:36.868 --> 00:04:40.367
-Well, basically the idea
came because I was like,

00:04:40.367 --> 00:04:42.601
"You know, Chris, we should
do some shows together.

00:04:42.601 --> 00:04:44.934
How about we just do New York
and Jersey together?"

00:04:44.934 --> 00:04:46.267
Chris was like, "Cool."

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:49.534
And I said, "Dude, if we do it,
Chappelle's gonna come."

00:04:49.534 --> 00:04:50.734
And Rock was like,
"Yeah, no, he'll come."

00:04:50.734 --> 00:04:51.901
And I said, "It'll be like,

00:04:51.901 --> 00:04:53.467
the biggest night in history
if he comes."

00:04:53.467 --> 00:04:57.267
So, then I told Dave, I said,
"Hey, man, I'm going to gift

00:04:57.267 --> 00:04:59.467
Chris a goat
at the end of the show."

00:04:59.467 --> 00:05:00.634
He said, "What do you mean?"
I said, "What do you mean,

00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:02.367
what do I mean?
I'm gonna go get a goat."

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:03.834
He said, "How you gonna
get a goat?"

00:05:03.834 --> 00:05:05.100
I said, "I'm Kevin Hart.
What do you mean,

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:06.234
