I can get a goat."

00:05:06.234 --> 00:05:08.000
[ Laughter ]
-How do you get a goat?

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.000
-What do you mean,
how do you get a goat?

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.167
You don't know
how to get a goat?

00:05:10.167 --> 00:05:11.367
You call the goat guy.
-Okay, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:11.367 --> 00:05:13.467
Call the goat person.
-There's a goat guy.

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:16.100
You call him, tell him I need
a goat, bring the goat.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.767
And next thing you know,
you got the goat.

00:05:17.767 --> 00:05:19.334
So, we get the goat.

00:05:19.334 --> 00:05:21.667
We get the goat,
but I hid the goat from Chris.

00:05:21.667 --> 00:05:23.901
I didn't want him to see it.
Dave knew about the goat.

00:05:23.901 --> 00:05:27.000
And at the end of the show,
an amazing show,

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.767
