-Chris did?

00:06:00.534 --> 00:06:02.000
-Yeah, yeah, Chris did, man,
it was a real moment.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.801
Like, you don't see
that in our culture enough.

00:06:05.801 --> 00:06:09.701
You don't see us share
the spotlight, and us --

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:14.000
