you know, the --

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.234
in the space of "there doesn't
have to just be one."

00:06:16.234 --> 00:06:17.534
Right?
Like, there's been this thing of

00:06:17.534 --> 00:06:19.400
"it can only be one guy,
or one funny guy at the top."

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.267
-Yeah, greatest of all time.
-And it's not the case.

00:06:22.267 --> 00:06:24.400
There's so many.
There's so much talent,

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.667
and we should all celebrate
each other more.

00:06:26.667 --> 00:06:27.701
And that's what that moment
was about,

00:06:27.701 --> 00:06:29.133
it was about celebrating
my brother.

00:06:29.133 --> 00:06:32.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
-I love that.

00:06:32.234 --> 00:06:33.968
-Quest was there.

00:06:33.968 --> 00:06:36.067
-Questlove was there.
I was like,

00:06:36.067 --> 00:06:39.801
"Dude, how do you top --
how do you top Dave Chappelle?

00:06:39.801 --> 00:06:40.968
How do you top Chris Rock?

00:06:40.968 --> 00:06:42.434
How do you top Kevin Hart?"

00:06:42.434 --> 00:06:44.968
