00:08:42.334 --> 00:08:43.501
-Who ruins your life.

00:08:43.501 --> 00:08:45.000
-Well, that's
a very good breakdown.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.400
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.467
You know, look, it's not about
your life being ruined.

00:08:48.467 --> 00:08:51.367
It's about your past
becoming your present,

00:08:51.367 --> 00:08:54.167
and you not being prepared
for your present.

00:08:54.167 --> 00:08:56.567
I play a character who just
needs some time to himself.

00:08:56.567 --> 00:08:58.267
He hasn't had alone time.

00:08:58.267 --> 00:09:00.133
He's a dedicated father,

00:09:00.133 --> 00:09:02.434
and his kids have kind of
taken over his life.

00:09:02.434 --> 00:09:05.200
And because he's been consumed
in that, he forgot how to live.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.634
And my best friend of old
comes back

00:09:07.634 --> 00:09:09.367
and shows me how to live again.

00:09:09.367 --> 00:09:10.601
But what he shows me,

00:09:10.601 --> 00:09:13.534
it creates nothing
but turmoil and problems for me.

00:09:13.534 --> 00:09:15.100
It's a comedy adventure,

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.567
Mark Wahlberg, myself,
Regina Hall.

00:09:17.567 --> 00:09:19.801
-I will say there's a tortoise
involved in this movie.

00:09:19.801 --> 00:09:21.234
-There is a tortoise.
-And it's very, very funny.

00:09:21.234 --> 00:09:22.901
-Do you like tortoises?
-Yeah.

00:09:22.901 --> 00:09:24.601
-I got to know tortoises
very well doing this movie.

00:09:24.601 --> 00:09:25.801
I spent a lot of time with them.

00:09:25.801 --> 00:09:27.100
-You got a goat guy,
you got a tortoise guy.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.267
-I got every guy.
-You got every kind of guy.

00:09:28.267 --> 00:09:29.467
What do you want?
-Tell me what you want,

00:09:29.467 --> 00:09:31.467
I can get it for you right now.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:31.467 --> 00:09:33.067
-I want to talk about
another big movie you have.

00:09:33.067 --> 00:09:35.067
-Okay. 'Cause I got a lot.
-We both have kids.

00:09:35.067 --> 00:09:37.767
You do have a lot.
-But "DC League of Super-Pets."

00:09:37.767 --> 00:09:38.934
-You better have brought it up.

00:09:38.934 --> 00:09:40.501
-That's right.
It comes out this Friday.

00:09:40.501 --> 00:09:43.167
-This Friday, yes.
-Unbelievable cast.

00:09:43.167 --> 00:09:44.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:44.801 --> 00:09:50.467
Dwayne Johnson, John Krasinski,
Kate McKinnon, Keanu Reeves.

00:09:50.467 --> 00:09:51.901
Should we set it up?

00:09:51.901 --> 00:09:53.434
Let's go to commercial, and
I'll set up when we come back.

00:09:53.434 --> 00:09:54.734
-Go to commercial, let's set
it up when we come back.

00:09:54.734 --> 00:09:56.501
-'Cause then, I also want
to talk about the tortilla slap.

00:09:56.501 --> 00:09:57.567
-Okay, we gotta do that.

00:09:57.567 --> 00:09:59.367
By the way, by the way,
I got your back.

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:00.534
Go.

00:10:00.534 --> 00:10:01.801
-More with Kevin Hart
after the break.

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:03.300
Stick around everybody.
You've got my back?

